<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Capital One cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Capital One cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded Capital One Financial Corp to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission on Wednesday, Capital One said it expects its second quarter earnings to be flat compared with last year's second quarter earnings of $0.57 a share.</p>
<p>-- On a consensus basis, analysts had expected Capital One to post second quarter earnings of $0.66 a share, according to First Call.</p>
<p>-- Capital One gained 1/4 to 36-5/8.</p>
</text>
